# Cache rules for static hosts that read this file (Cloudflare Pages, Netlify; others ignore it).
# Everything the admin loads is revalidated on each visit (a cheap 304 when unchanged), so a
# deploy is picked up immediately. scripts/stamp-build.sh additionally versions every JS/CSS
# URL, which covers hosts and CDNs that don't honour this file.
#
# Security headers: the admin can't be framed by another site (clickjacking), the browser
# won't guess content types, and full admin URLs aren't sent to other sites as the Referer.
/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: same-origin
